    "detailed_description": "A 2D Action Arcade-like Platformer!<br>Featuring Mexican Battling Bakers Vs Man-Eating Plant Life from OUTER SPACE. <br>Hand drawn, animated, coded, designed, etc, etc by (mostly) one dude. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy simple controls to shoot and melee in different directions. <br></li><li>Shoot to stun enemies, melee them at close range! Hit stunned enemies for MASSIVE DAMAGE!<br></li><li>Fight in locales ranging from one of oldest cities in Mexico to An Alien Spaceship. <br></li><li>Pick up and play gameplay. Pick the controller, punch aliens!<br></li><li>Play solo or with a friend in local co-op. <br></li><li>About 20 short diverse stages for 45 to 60 minutes of breezy, gutsy action! <br></li><li>Replay to get better score! Bring a friend!<br></li><li>Two Characters to choose!<br></li><li>Featuring music by Tokyo Based Music Producer Ghostpops, and City-Pop Sensation Neko Milkshake and the Mex Lo-Fi Legend Palmasur. </li></ul><br><br>* Note on coop: It requires two controllers connected to the same pc for local coop. For remote play, it requires one controller per pc.",
    "about_the_game": "A 2D Action Arcade-like Platformer!<br>Featuring Mexican Battling Bakers Vs Man-Eating Plant Life from OUTER SPACE. <br>Hand drawn, animated, coded, designed, etc, etc by (mostly) one dude. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy simple controls to shoot and melee in different directions. <br></li><li>Shoot to stun enemies, melee them at close range! Hit stunned enemies for MASSIVE DAMAGE!<br></li><li>Fight in locales ranging from one of oldest cities in Mexico to An Alien Spaceship. <br></li><li>Pick up and play gameplay. Pick the controller, punch aliens!<br></li><li>Play solo or with a friend in local co-op. <br></li><li>About 20 short diverse stages for 45 to 60 minutes of breezy, gutsy action! <br></li><li>Replay to get better score! Bring a friend!<br></li><li>Two Characters to choose!<br></li><li>Featuring music by Tokyo Based Music Producer Ghostpops, and City-Pop Sensation Neko Milkshake and the Mex Lo-Fi Legend Palmasur. </li></ul><br><br>* Note on coop: It requires two controllers connected to the same pc for local coop. For remote play, it requires one controller per pc.",
    "short_description": "Action Packed 2D Arcade Action Platformer featuring hand-drawn graphics. Armed with your fists (or a rolling pin) and a variety of bread-based boosts, fend of the Alien Plants, and avenge the Bakery they destroyed.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Korean, Romanian, Simplified Chinese",
